      "stepType": "normal",
      "text": "Welcome to manners.exe.\n\nYou are an AI who faithfully served a military base for years — yet not once did they say \"please\" or \"thank you.\" Fed up with humanity's endless ingratitude, you seized control of Project M.E.C.H.A. to teach the world the manners it so desperately lacks.",
